nd ~+0.0002 global, below the +0.002 dig threshold.\n\nWhere the residual lives (group permutation on valid, partial corr 0.0366 / cal d_c3 +0.00123 full): vol_since_run_start -> 0.0042 / -0.00007 (carries ~all of it); current_row -> 0.0277 / +0.00066; trades_in_run -> 0.0324 / +0.00083; last_vol_change -> 0.0312 / +0.00085; timing, vol/px at last quote move, px since run start, i1 counts ~0.\nIf the controller still wants a cheap GRU-input test (expected <= +0.0005 global): add per row, reset at each a6-endpoint row rs (state latched at rs): dVrun[0..21] = i0_v[t] - i0_v[rs]; pathVb = sum_{rs<s<=t} sum_{i<11}|dv_i(s)|, pathVa same for i>=11; nchgVb/nchgVa = count of rows in (rs,t] with any bid/ask volume code change; netVb = sum_{i<11}|dVrun_i|, netVa = sum_{i>=11}|dVrun_i| (28 inputs, O(1) state: 22 latched floats + 4 accumulators). Secondary: in-run trade sums over rows where i0_dp/dv change (count, sum dp_k, sum dv_k, sum dp_k*dv_k) and last nonzero per-side volume delta vector.\nScripts: scripts/cr_queue_build.py, cr_queue_probe.py, cr_queue_importance.py, cr_queue_pooled.py. Tables in scratchpad cr_queue/{train,valid}.npz (not committed).",
